From 3c04dba52bee3976f2a20b1e4b09dc81263c2382 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Srinu Jella <quic_sjella@quicinc.com>
Date: Fri, 8 Jul 2022 17:18:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 040/100] Stack: Add support for split a2dp sink

- Add support for sending start indication,
  suspend indication to upper layers at
  avdt layer.

- Add support for sending start request to
  app so that application can intimate audio
  hal about the sink start for split mode.

- Later MM audio hal updates the start
  confirmation via hidl path.

- Add support for HIDL session management for
  split sink.

- Add support for split sink mode at audio
  hal interface layer.

CRs-Fixed: 3245176
Change-Id: If006180a17b440819f290eaf0792424161c7ddd7
